# Cloudflare Pages serves static files and, for anything it doesn't recognise,
# a 404 — so without this every deep link into the app was a dead page. The
# routes are entirely client-side (createBrowserRouter), which means the server
# has to hand index.html to any path and let React Router take it from there.
#
# 200, not 301: the URL the visitor typed has to survive, or /ua/painting/12
# would become / before the router ever sees it.
/*    /index.html   200
